{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21797","headline":"有鸟二十章 十一 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟名燕子，口中未省无泥滓。\n春风吹送廊庑间，秋社驱将嵌孔里。\n雷惊雨洒一时苏，云压霜摧半年死。\n驱去驱来长信风，暂托栋梁何用喜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}